Phase 20 — Real Production Troubleshooting 🔥🔥

Ye sabse important phase hoga.

Hum scenarios solve karenge:

Scenario 1

Website down.

Scenario 2

CPU 100%.

Scenario 3

Memory full.

Scenario 4

Disk full.

Scenario 5

Nginx not working.

Scenario 6

Application not starting.

Scenario 7

Port unreachable.

Scenario 8

DNS issue.

Scenario 9

Permission denied.

Scenario 10

SSH connection failed.

Scenario 11

Server slow.

Scenario 12

Process consuming too much memory.

Scenario 13

Deployment failed.

Scenario 14

Docker container crashing.

Scenario 15

Kubernetes pod failing.

Yahan tum actual DevOps Engineer ki tarah sochogi.

🧠 Aur Har Topic Ka Learning Pattern Same Rahega

Kisi bhi concept ko hum aise padhenge:

WHY → HISTORY → CONCEPT → INTERNAL WORKING → COMMANDS → HANDS-ON → INDUSTRY USE → DEVOPS CONNECTION → REAL SCENARIO → INTERVIEW

Example:

systemd

Hum simply ye nahi padhenge:

systemctl restart nginx

Instead:

Why service manager?

↓

Linux boot process

↓

init → systemd evolution

↓

systemd architecture

↓

service unit

↓

systemctl

↓

Nginx service

↓

Production deployment

↓

Service failure troubleshooting

↓

Interview scenarios

Tab jaake concept dimaag me permanently connect hoga.

🎯 Final Linux Syllabus

Hamare Linux journey ke major pillars:

#	Area	DevOps Importance
1	Linux History & Philosophy	⭐⭐⭐
2	Architecture & Kernel	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
3	Filesystem	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
4	Files & Text Processing	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
5	Users & Permissions	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
6	Processes	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
7	systemd & Services	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
8	Networking	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
9	SSH	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
10	Package Management	⭐⭐⭐⭐
11	Storage	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
12	Logs & Monitoring	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
13	Bash Scripting	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
14	Environment & Configuration	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
15	Security	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
16	Git + Linux	⭐⭐⭐⭐
17	Docker + Linux	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
18	CI/CD + Linux	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
19	Kubernetes + Linux	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
20	AWS + Linux	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
21	Production Troubleshooting	⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
🚨 Aur ek important baat

Hum Linux ko DevOps se alag subject nahi rakhenge.

Har Linux concept ke saath uska connection banega:

Linux
  │
  ├── Networking
  ├── Security
  ├── Bash
  ├── Git
  │
  ├── Docker
  │     └── Containers
  │
  ├── CI/CD
  │
  ├── AWS
  │
  └── Kubernetes

Isse jab hum baad me Docker, Jenkins, AWS, Kubernetes padhenge, tumhe lagega:

"Ohhh, ye to Linux ke us concept ka extension hai!" 😎

Isi roadmap ko hum apna Linux syllabus maan sakte hain. Commands isme sirf ek chhota part hain; main focus concept + internals + industry + DevOps + troubleshooting + interview rahega.